1 NOTE {geni:about_me} When Francisca Javiera Roberta Carrera Fontecilla was born on 29 April 1818, in Buenos Aires, Argentina, her father, José Miguel Carrera y Verdugo, was 32 and her mother, María de las Mercedes Josefa Fontecilla y F
2 CONC ernández de Valdivieso, was 18. She married Francisco Javier Valdés Aldunate on 3 May 1835, in El Sagrario, Santiago, Chile. They were the parents of at least 8 sons and 4 daughters. She died in 1886, in Santiago, Chile, at the ag
2 CONC e of 68.
